@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans CJK SC
skinparam defaultFontSize 22
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFBF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceArrowFontSize 20
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 22
skinparam maxMessageSize 270
hide footbox
title 核心领域：未来准备与个人实际分开
left to right direction
class "计划版本" as P {
确认范围与模式
}
class "计划餐次" as M {
日期、餐次、人数
}
class "计划食物" as F {
准备份量与基准
}
class "食材需求" as I {
标准食材、量或未知
}
class "采购清单" as L {
来源版本与独立状态
}
class "库存核对" as S {
人工数量、单位、修订
}
class "个人用餐版本" as A {
实际日期、餐次
}
class "实际食物" as B {
个人份量与出处
}
P "1" *-- "1..*" M
M "1" *-- "1..*" F
F "1" *-- "0..*" I
P "1" <-- "0..*" L : 引用确认版本
L ..> I : 汇总可追溯需求
L ..> S : 读取，不扣减
A "1" *-- "1..*" B
B "0..*" --> "0..1" F : 可选预填出处
note bottom of A
同一午餐可有多次用餐；
餐次覆盖按槽位去重。
end note
@enduml
